    "detailed_description": "The massive sequel to Shadow of Azrael is here! Take control of over a dozen unique characters and experience high octane, high powered combat like never before! Fight with combatants that can fly, shoot massive beam attacks, move at super speeds, and level up as the combat progresses. Highly customizable options also allows you to take control and create your own fighting experience. Turn down the combat to a normal street fight or crank it up to eleven and watch your fighters fly. The choice is up to you how you want to fight!<br><br><br><br><strong>      <u>Featuring</u>:</strong><br>   \u2022 <strong>4-Player Local</strong> Smash-like combat with RPG elements.<br>   \u2022 <strong>19 playable characters</strong> and <strong><i>6 new fighters</i></strong> with their own unique abilities.<br>   \u2022 New <strong>alternate colors</strong>, Improved graphics, new new moves and <strong>new animations</strong>.<br>   \u2022 <strong>New stages</strong> and a new stage select screen.<br>   \u2022 New <strong>grabbing </strong>and <strong>throwing </strong>abilities.<br>   \u2022 Contest your enormous beam attacks during <strong>Beam Struggles</strong>.<br>   \u2022 <strong>Improved AI</strong> that are more human-like.<br>   \u2022 <strong>New items</strong> and special effects.<br><br><br><br><strong>      <u>Coming soon</u>:</strong><br>   \u2022 In-depth<strong> player guides</strong> and <strong>game instructions</strong>.<br>   \u2022 An <strong>improved campaign</strong> and <strong>story mode</strong> with in-depth lore.<br>   \u2022 <strong>Button Mapping</strong> and control customization.<br><br><br>Be sure to check out and follow our <strong>Steam Store</strong> for more titles from Dream Within.",
